{
  "name": "JwsForge - nano-tools",
  "short_name": "JwsForge",
  "description": "JWS 工作台：手写实现 RFC 7515 的紧凑与 JSON（general / flattened）序列化解析，支持 detached 载荷；用 JWK 验签 HS256/384/512、RS256/384/512、ES256/384/512（RSA-PSS 提示走浏览器端 WebCrypto），并用私钥 JWK 签发上述算法的紧凑 JWS，全部纯 JS 同步、不依赖 WebCrypto、离线可用。 · 单文件 · 零依赖 · 本地优先",
  "start_url": "./",
  "scope": "./",
  "display": "standalone",
  "background_color": "#0A0A0B",
  "theme_color": "#5E6AD2",
  "icons": [
    {
      "src": "og.svg",
      "sizes": "any",
      "type": "image/svg+xml",
      "purpose": "any"
    }
  ]
}
